        <activityName xml:lang="en">Packaging box production unit</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Packaging box production unit
The dataset represents a packaging production site with a annual production of 14 kt and a total life time of 50 years.;
UUID: e698ea6c-4e76-3ea0-822e-b7e7f25dc05a
this module includes the land-use, buildings (hall), machineries for box production as well as the dismanteling/disposal of the whole infrastructure
Location: Land-use from 1 Swiss packaging box producer, used here for whole Europe
Technology: estimation of typical technology for packaging box production
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature and estimations from similar processes 
Extrapolations: Land-use data are based on one production site. Other information is rough estimation.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e698ea6c-4e76-3ea0-822e-b7e7f25dc05a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
